*======================================================================
* SPICE Model generated by Coilcraft
* Coilcraft Part Number : 2222SQ-90N
* Inductance = 90nH
*======================================================================
* Model Parameters:
*   Valid Frequency Range = 10MHz-1.4GHz
*   Ambient Temperature = 25 degC
*   Inductor TLine Model
*   Use model for Frequency Domain simulations
*======================================================================
.subckt 2222SQ-90N port1 port2 PARAMS: Cpar=0.1796pF
X1 port1 port2 Model3B PARAMS:
+ R1=93.6
+ R2=0.203
+ C= {Cpar}
+ L_Z0=604
+ L_EL=56.4
+ L_F0=1050E6
.ends 2222SQ-90N

